    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but a break? i've taken breaks. i've tried new things. it's not a slump. it's like the spark is just dead. i'm not just waiting for inspiration to come back, i'm realizing it's never coming back. i can feel my talent slipping away every day. i'd rather stop now while i'm still 'something' than live to see myself become a joke.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
