    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i don't want a \"new purpose.\" that feels like a consolation prize for failing at the one thing i was actually meant to do. i'd rather leave it all on the table now—leaving with my dignity intact—than stick around to watch myself decay into someone mediocre. maybe there is some kind of grace in just... walking away for good. don't you think?",
