      "content": "It's a profound and difficult realisation, acknowledging the point of no return. Walking away with dignity intact and a sense of self-respect can indeed be a form of grace. In many cases, accepting when a dream or passion has run its course is a sign of strength, not weakness. Recognizing when to let go can be the hardest part, but it's a necessary step towards healing and finding new paths.",
